👤 Angelline: Networking & Server Core
🛠 Tasks:
    Socket creation and setup (binding, listening, accept)
    Non-blocking I/O using poll() (or select() / kqueue() / epoll())
    Managing file descriptors and events
    Multiplexing and handling multiple client connections
    Handling client disconnections
    Graceful shutdown and signals

🧠 Why it's important:
    This is the core of your web server. It ensures non-blocking, event-driven communication and that all clients are handled efficiently.

🔍 Focus areas:
    socket(), bind(), listen(), accept()
    fcntl() for non-blocking mode
    poll() (or equivalent)
    recv(), send()
    Connection timeout and error handling

